## Distribution of Total Score (8) Among Sub-Indicators

### Step 1: Weights of Sub-Indicators  
The weights of the sub-indicators are as follows:  

| **Sub-Indicator** | **Weight (%)** | **Decimal Equivalent** |
|--------------------|----------------|-------------------------|
| Sub-indicator 1    | 20%            | 0.20                   |
